# /sdd-analyze

Description:
  Analyze and explain the .sdd/ system structure. Read-only — does not
  modify any files.

Usage:
  /sdd-analyze
  /sdd-analyze --chains
  /sdd-analyze --decisions
  /sdd-analyze --project

Options:
  --chains     Focus on chain graph
  --decisions  Focus on decision ledger
  --project    Focus on project structure

Output:
  System overview, chain graph, decisions, project modules,
  and recommended next steps.

State: +
